  "notes_on_unsupported_frontend_capabilities": [
    "Do not design binary file upload widgets that imply transport to the backend; only metadata/raw_text/source_uri registration is supported.",
    "Do not design tenant switcher backed by an API list/detail endpoint; none exists in the authoritative contract.",
    "Do not design edit/delete actions for documents, prompts, runs, or tenants.",
    "Do not design a frontend control that triggers chunk generation; chunk creation is an internal pipeline concern and only inspection is exposed.",
    "Do not claim cost-analysis APIs or baseline-system execution APIs exist. The frontend can record benchmark runs for systems like elastic/opensearch/qdrant/internal_baseline, but execution/import of those baseline results must come from user/operator workflows outside the provided API.",
    "Do not expose agent-memory keyword or hybrid retrieval because no such endpoint exists."
  ]
}